📱 **iOS app beta shipped** to 100 internal users - Collecting feedback
⚡ **Database optimization** - Query performance improved 40% (avg 120ms → 72ms)
👥 **Onboarded 2 new engineers** - Maria (Backend) and James (Frontend) ramping up"""

