  def heading "Challenges & Risks"
    level 2

  def callout "⚠️ Risk #1 (Medium): Mobile app performance degradation"
    variant warning

  def paragraph "iOS app load time increased from 2.1s to 3.2s after recent changes. Root cause under investigation - likely related to image loading logic. Impact: Could affect user experience and App Store ratings."

  def list
    items """**Mitigation**: Priya leading investigation, targeting fix by Wed Jan 22
**Backup plan**: Roll back last 3 commits if needed
**Help needed**: None yet, will escalate if not resolved by Thu"""

  def callout "⚠️ Risk #2 (Low): Test automation lagging behind development"

  def paragraph "Test coverage at 87%, targeting 90% by end of Q1. Gap growing slightly as new features ship faster than test creation."

  def list
    items """**Mitigation**: Allocated 20% of each engineer's time to test writing
**Tracking**: Weekly coverage reports in team dashboards"""

